{"id":"wb-3-144","name":"三影塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"三影塔","text":"三影塔，又名延祥寺塔，位于广东省韶关市南雄市雄州街道永康路，是一座六角楼阁式塔。该塔通高50.2米，建成于北宋大中祥符二年（1009年），此后历代均有修葺。中华人民共和国成立后，于20世纪80年代予以重修。1988年，三影塔被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E5%BD%B1%E5%A1%94","revisionId":88944219,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88944219","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/484ccd84dea6711dcc8ae6e1.jpg","title":"Nanxiong_Sanying_Ta_2014.01.12_08-39-30.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nanxiong_Sanying_Ta_2014.01.12_08-39-30.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b3/Nanxiong_Sanying_Ta_2014.01.12_08-39-30.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"广东南雄三影塔","width":320,"height":480}}